{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03105","headline":"故徐州刺史赠吏部侍郎苏公挽歌词三首 三 · 张九龄","name":"故徐州刺史赠吏部侍郎苏公挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返葬长安陌，秋风箫鼓悲。\n奈何相送者，不是平生时。\n寒影催年急，哀歌助晚迟。\n宁知建旟罢，丹旐向京师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}